# Plugin: Writing Plans

Purpose:
  Adapt writing-plans skill for SDDRA S1 arm.

Owns: plugins\plugin-adapters\writing-plans.sdd
Adaptation:
  Breaks work into bite-sized tasks:
    Input: approved docs/
    Output: .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/*.sdd

  Task structure:
    id, title, decision, chain, dependencies, skills, inputs, outputs, verification

Usage:
  Chain: S1 (sdd arm)
  Trigger: Human approves docs, task generation needed

State: +
